                  className="creator-success"
                  style={{
                    color: "#28a745",
                    fontWeight: "bold",
                    marginTop: "16px",
                    padding: "12px",
                    background: "#f0fff4",
                    borderRadius: "6px",
                    border: "1px solid #c6f6d5"
                  }}
                >
                  ✓ Thank you! Your application has been submitted successfully. Our Creator Partnerships Team will review your portfolio and get in touch with you.
                </p>
              )}
            </div>
          </form>
        </div>
      </section>

      {/* Selection Process */}
